OL,3,ARange Rover launches first fully
OL,4,Aelectric model
OL,5,
OL,6,FRange Rover has unveiled its first
OL,7,Ffully electric model, after a
OL,8,Fyearb@Qlong delay to its planned
OL,9,Flaunch.
OL,11,FThe Range Rover Electric, to be built
OL,12,Fin Solihull, marks a major shift in its
OL,13,Felectrification programme, backed by
OL,14,Flargeb@Qscale upgrades across its West
OL,15,FMidlands sites.
OL,17,FParent company JLR said it had
OL,18,Fup-skilled 10,500 workers for electric
OL,19,Fproduction as it pushes ahead with
OL,20,Fmodernisation despite recent financial
OL,21,Fpressures and planned job cuts.
